# Disc images. The game itself must never be committed -- the build only needs
# the executable extracted into disc/, ignored above, not the image. The
# root-only patterns are the shapes a dump arrives in; nested .bin/.img stay
# available for project files.
*.iso
*.mdf
*.mds
*.nrg
*.cue
/*.bin
/*.img

